date-released: "2026-11-12"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22836247
title: "monotile-ca: cellular automata on the hat and spectre aperiodic monotilings"
abstract: "Toolchain, search drivers, and the complete replayable result set behind 'Gliders on Aperiodic Monotilings: Cellular Automata on the Hat and Spectre' and 'Certificates of Immortality for Gliders on the Hat and Spectre Tilings', with their companion interactive essay: transducer-generated patches of the hat, spectre and Penrose tilings, a no_std graph cellular-automaton engine (native and WebAssembly), exhaustive and evolutionary rule-space search with structural anti-gaming controls, cross-radius verification, a constant-memory sliding-window tracker, and the certify crate (legal-ball atlases by transducer exploration, situation closures, exact cocycles) with the ten certificates and an independent checker, and the glider census: the records of its 32 certified travelling objects and the table of commands that rebuild their certificates."
